    <abstract>
        <para>Records of innvasive non-native species from the Outer Hebrides recorded up to 31 December 2019. Includes records collected directly from individual recorders.

Please refer to OHBR website (www.ohbr.org.uk) or contact admin&amp;#64;ohbr.org.uk
OHBR maintains a regional database of records of the flora, fungi and fauna of the Outer Hebrides and the surrounding marine areas.</para>
    </abstract>
